# The game's own log (pLog->err / warn / mes, db_log.cpp) into the port log.
# On the GameCube each line went to the screen and, through printf, to the
# debugger console; the port has no console on Android, so messages such as
# "GetPrimBuff() : OVERFLOW" (draws dropped) or "SmdInit() NULL BIN USED" were
# lost. re4_game_log (runtime/log.cpp) logs each message (by its format
# string) the first 3 times, then every 1000th time with its count.
